{"id":"fbf91595366c330b","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-finitely-complete-category.md","title":"Finitely Complete Category","display":"df-finitely-complete-category — Finitely Complete Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-finitely-complete-category","aliases":["93-df-finitely-complete-category"],"display":"df-finitely-complete-category — Finitely Complete Category","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]","[[93-df-pullback]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-finitely-complete-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-finitely-complete-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finitely-complete-category — Finitely Complete Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7702f850d0f755f5\" href=\"?note=7702f850d0f755f5\" title=\"93-df-pullback\">93-df-pullback</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}\\)</span> (the pullback predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7702f850d0f755f5\" href=\"?note=7702f850d0f755f5\" title=\"93-df-pullback\">93-df-pullback</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}\\)</span> (the finite-completeness predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}complete\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\exists!u\\;\\bigl(u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,T)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall A,B,D\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D)\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\exists p_A\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,A)\\;\n\\exists p_B\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_A,p_B,f,g,A,B,D,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}complete\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\exists!u\\;\\bigl(u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,T)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall A,B,D\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D)\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\exists p_A\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,A)\\;\n\\exists p_B\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_A,p_B,f,g,A,B,D,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A category has all finite limits exactly when it has a terminal object and pullbacks of all cospans; this equivalent presentation avoids an undeclared diagram language.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"7702f850d0f755f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$, with $\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}$ as in [[93-df-category]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"7702f850d0f755f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}$ (the pullback predicate of [[93-df-pullback]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}complete\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl[\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\exists!u\\;\\bigl(u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,T)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl[\\forall A,B,D\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D)\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,D)\\\\\n&\\quad\\exists P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\exists p_A\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,A)\\;\n\\exists p_B\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_A,p_B,f,g,A,B,D,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1551,"backlinks":[{"id":"703de0dbb1e0c2b6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}$ (finite-completeness predicate, see [[93-df-finitely-complete-category]])"},{"id":"dbf8e12e31001be4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$ (see [[93-df-finitely-complete-category]])"},{"id":"9a0e4e3dae0f2467","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$ (see [[93-df-finitely-complete-category]])"},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-finitely-complete-category]]"}],"outgoing":["aa74a8aadef06b6c","7702f850d0f755f5"]}